<BaseLayout title="FAQ">
  <h1>FAQ</h1>

  <h2>What do I work on?</h2>
  <p>I work on durable professional themes: generative media and computer vision. I'm currently a Research Engineer at Dashtoon.</p>

  <h2>What do I write about here?</h2>
  <p>I write dev logs, experiments, side quests, and occasional thoughts.</p>

  <h2>Why is the site called ayvbrg.log?</h2>
  <p>
    ayvbrg is a compressed form of Ayushman Buragohain; <code>.log</code> is the
    ongoing record.
  </p>

  <h2>What am I curious about?</h2>
  <p>I'm curious about generative image/video, computer vision, developer tools and agent-assisted workflows, and game development with Godot. Starwater is a concrete example of learning Godot from zero.</p>

  <h2>How can I follow new Entries?</h2>
  <p>
    I follow new Entries via <a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>How can I report an error or contact you?</h2>
  <p>
    You can reach me at <a href="mailto:aburagohain160@gmail.com">aburagohain160@gmail.com</a>, and check the verified profiles: <a href="https://github.com/ayvbrg">ayvbrg</a> on GitHub and <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ayushman-buragohain">ayushman-buragohain</a> on LinkedIn.
  </p>

  <h2>Do I revise older Entries?</h2>
  <p>Yes. When I make material revisions, the entry gets an Updated date.</p>
</BaseLayout>

